    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Worldwide there is an increasing recognition as well as potential interventions to help bring qualified women to leadership positions. We need to engage, recognize, advocate and sponsor women in academia to change the current status quo,\" said Dr Sarah Nadeem, an assistant professor in the department of medicine at Aga Khan University.",
